MLs have a cold touch for 3d6 damage, which cold resistance or even 
magic cancellation effectively nullifies, and a random magical spell 
attack. They can only cast ToD if they're level 21 or higher, and MLs 
range from level 17 to 24. The other spell to be concerned about is 
Destroy armor, which can be cast from level 9 upwards.

> There are also several golden nagas in the castle. These won't teleport to
